1550 0 obj
  << /ActualText (UX Research \046 Concept Design Al Jazira Capital\054 KSA \050Wealth Management\051\nConducted 10\053 in\055depth stakeholder interviews and focus group discussions with department heads across front office\054 middle office\054 and back office uncovering unmet user needs\054 workflow friction\054 and business constraints across the wealth management platform\056\nPerformed a full heuristic evaluation of Al Jazira Capital\220s existing product\054 identifying usability issues across key user touchpoints and documenting findings with severity ratings and design recommendations\056\nLed competitive analysis across 5 leading wealth management platforms\054 benchmarking features\054 UI patterns\054 and visual design to identify industry gaps and opportunities for differentiation\056\nSynthesized all research into user personas and customer journey maps for distinct user segments\054 capturing goals\054 pain points\054 emotional highs and lows\054 and unmet needs across the end\055to\055end product experience\056\nTranslated research findings into prioritized digital use cases\054 identifying the highest\055impact opportunities and mapping them to user problems and business goals\056\nCreated concept designs for select high\055priority use cases designing screen\055level UI concepts for different user segments to communicate product direction and design intent to senior stakeholders\056\nAuthored a 260\053 page research and design report consolidating all research insights\054 Executive summary personas\054 journey maps\054 competitive findings\054 Vision Calibration\054 Target  Enterprise Architecture\054 Roadmap\054 Digital north star\054  use cases\054 and concept designs presented directly to senior leadership to guide the client\220s digital product strategy\056)
     /K [ 12 ]
     /P 1551 0 R
     /Pg 1489 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

