1552 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Project\072 UX Design AI Dominance \050Internal AI Enablement Platform\054 Nagarro\051\nDefined the information architecture and navigation model for AI Dominance\054 Nagarro\220s internal AI platform\054 designing intuitive user flows that enabled employees across departments to discover and adopt AI tools with minimal onboarding friction\056\015\nCreated end\055to\055end wireframes\054 interaction flows\054 and high\055fidelity clickable prototypes in Figma\054 iterating across multiple design rounds based on usability feedback from cross\055functional teams\056\015\nFacilitated moderated usability testing sessions\054 identified key friction points in the prototype\054 and applied research findings to iterate the design  achieving a 4\0565\0575 internal user satisfaction score post\055launch\056\015\nDesigned UX artifacts including user flows\054 task flows\054 and component\055level interaction patterns that defined how different user roles  core team\054 operations\054 and department SPOCs experience the platform\056\015)
     /K [ 13 ]
     /P 1553 0 R
     /Pg 1489 0 R
     /S /Span
